      "content": "thanks, that's helpful. i want to make sure the kids really get the distinction. so, for the lesson, should we basically frame it as a discussion about how revolutionary ideas are the ones that move us forward, while regressive ideas are basically just roadblocks to social justice? i want to make sure they walk away knowing which side of the debate actually represents progress.",
